# 2026-09-16 — the first-vetter bootstrap, on documented surfaces only.
#
# 1. community criteria: invitation only        (delete-criterion vetted-member)
# 2. POST /v1/invitations  subjectDid=<fresh did:key>          -> 201, InvitationCredential
# 3. submit/0.2 with that credential in the presentation        -> verdict allow,
#    MembershipCredential + role EndorsementCredential inline   (submit-0.2-invitation-allow.log)
# 4. POST /v1/vetting/vetters  memberDid=<same did>             -> 201, below
# 5. restore the vetting criterion                              (put-criterion criterion.json)
#
# The subject here is an X25519-only did:key, which cannot sign a vetting
# statement; a vetter that will actually vet needs an Ed25519 identity. The point
# measured is the governance path, not the signing one.
[ref-20] POST /vetting/vetters -> 201
